place(/(\\d{3})(\\d{2})(\\d{5})/, '$1-$2-$3'),\n          title,\n          address: p,\n          h5s,\n          url: `https://bizno.net/article/${art}`\n        });\n      }\n    }\n    return results;\n  } catch (e) {\n    return [];\n  }\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n  console.log(`Starting STRICT BUSAN Bizno Search for ${targets.length} targets...`);\n  const matched = [];\n  const unmatched = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < targets.length; i++) {\n    const c = targets[i];\n    const cClean = cleanName(c.name);\n    const cGu = c.address.split(' ')[1] || '';\n    const cStreet = c.address.match(/([가-힣\\d]+(?:로|길)\\s*[\\d-]+)/)?.[1] || '';\n\n    // 1254 더플로우 (사용자 확인)\n    if (c.seq === '1254') {\n      matched.push({\n        seq: c.seq,\n        name: c.name,\n        targetCeo: c.ceo,\n        targetAddress: c.address,\n        bizNo: '899-37-01327',\n        matchedTitle: '더플로우',\n        matchedAddress: '부산광역시 해운대구 재반로125번길 30 (통신판매 신고)',\n        matchedCeo: '김선민/정연택',\n        matchReason: '사용자 직접 확인 및 해운대구 재반로 통신판매 사업자',\n        url: 'https://bizno.net/article/8993701327'\n      });\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    // 1288 빅토리아호텔\n    if (c.seq === '1288') {\n      matched.push({\n        seq: c.seq,\n        name: c.name,\n        targetCeo: c.ceo,\n        targetAddress: c.address,\n        bizNo: '364-10-02139',\n        matchedTitle: '센텀빅토리아호텔',\n        matchedAddress: '부산광역시 해운대구 센텀3로 20, 823호',\n        matchedCeo: '신유진',\n        matchReason: '상호, 대표자(신유진), 해운대구 센텀3로 20 823호 호수까지 100% 일치',\n        url: 'https://centumvictoriahotel.com'\n      });\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    // 1274 해운대스위트호텔\n    if (c.seq === '1274') {\n      matched.push({\n        seq: c.seq,\n        name: c.name,\n        targetCeo: c.ceo,\n        targetAddress: c.address,\n        bizNo: '838-88-02473',\n        matchedTitle: '(주)센텀스위트호텔',\n        matchedAddress: '부산광역시 해운대구',\n        matchedCeo: '신유진',\n        matchReason: '동일 대표(신유진) 해운대 스위트호텔 법인',\n        url: 'https://bizno.net/article/8388802473'\n      });\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const items = await searchBiznoByName(cClean);\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 120));\n\n    let best = null;\n    for (const cand of items) {\n      const candClean = cleanName(cand.title);\n      // STRICT 1: 상호명이 완전히 같거나 서로 포함해야 함\n      if (candClean !== cClean && !candClean.includes(cClean) && !cClean.includes(candClean)) continue;\n\n      // STRICT 2: 무조건 부산 소재여야 함!\n      if (!cand.address.includes('부산')) continue;\n\n      const candCeo = cand.h5s.find(h => h.length <= 4 && !h.includes('업') && !h.includes('소매') && !h.includes('제조') && !h.includes('서비스')) || '';\n      const isCeoMatch = candCeo && (candCeo.includes(c.ceo[0]) || candCeo === c.ceo);\n      const isGuMatch = cGu && cand.address.includes(cGu);\n      const isStreetMatch = cStreet && cand.address.includes(cStreet);\n\n      // 점수 계산\n      let score = 0;\n      if (candClean === cClean) score += 50;\n      if (isCeoMatch) score += 30;\n      if (isGuMatch) score += 20;\n      if (isStreetMatch) score += 40;\n\n      // 최소 조건: 상호 일치 + 부산 주소 + (동일 구 or 동일 도로 or 대표 성 일치)\n      if (score >= 70) {\n        if (!best || score > best.score) {\n          best = { ...cand, score, candCeo, isStreetMatch, isGuMatch, isCeoMatch };\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (best) {\n      console.log(`[FOUND] ${c.seq} ${c.name} (${c.ceo}) -> ${best.formattedBizNo} [${best.title} | ${best.candCeo} | ${best.address} | score:${best.score}]`);\n      matched.push({\n        seq: c.seq,\n        name: c.name,\n        targetCeo: c.ceo,\n        targetAddress: c.address,\n        bizNo: best.formattedBizNo,\n        matchedTitle: best.title,\n        matchedAddress: best.address,\n        matchedCeo: best.candCeo,\n        matchReason: `상호 일치(${best.title}) + 부산(${cGu}) 일치 ${best.isStreetMatch ? '+ 도로명 일치' : ''} ${best.isCeoMatch ? `+ 대표자(${best.candCeo})` : ''}`,\n        url: best.url\n      });\n    } else {\n      unmatched.push(c);\n    }\n  }\n\n  fs.writeFileSync('bizno_strict_matched.json', JSON.stringify(matched, null, 2), 'utf8');\n  fs.writeFileSync('bizno_strict_unmatched.json', JSON.stringify(unmatched, null, 2), 'utf8');\n  console.log(`\\nSTRICT Search Finished: Matched ${matched.length}, Unmatched ${unmatched.length}`);\n}\n\nrun();\n","Description":"Write strict busan bizno search","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\parse_company_data\\bizno_strict_busan.js","toolAction":"Writing strict busan search script","toolSummary":"Write bizno_strict_busan.js"}}]}
